OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAreas of fog to start but
OL,6,Flifting through the morning. Sunny
OL,7,Fspells and cloudy intervals, perhaps
OL,8,Fwith a light shower along the south
OL,9,Fcoast. A chilly day, though
OL,10,Ftemperatures will remain a touch
OL,11,Fmilder in southwest Cornwall.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry this evening, but rain
OL,14,Fwill bring persistent wet conditions
OL,15,Flater, with some heavy spells, for
OL,16,FDevon and Cornwall. Strong winds along
OL,17,Fthe south coast. Milder than on Friday
OL,18,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
